---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Partneři
permalink: /partneri/
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Partneři</h1>
    <p class="muted">Děkujeme našim sponzorům, kteří nás podporují.</p>

    {% set sponsorsList = sponsors.items | default([]) %}

    {% if sponsorsList | length == 0 %}
      <p class="muted">Zatím nemáme žádné partnery. Aktualizuj <code>_data/sponsors.json</code>.</p>
    {% else %}
      <ul class="sponsorsList">
        {% for s in sponsorsList %}
          <li>
            {% if s.url %}
              <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                {{ s.name | escape }}
              </a>
            {% else %}
              {{ s.name | escape }}
            {% endif %}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
